  m_text: 'When the night ends, the citizens, the mayor, and you will automatically
    gather at the Town Hall to vote.

    You can also go to the table in the center
    of the Town Hall to end the night and start voting.

    When voting begins,
    a menu will appear with:

    -List of citizens: choose who to accuse.

    -Evidence
    Found: Review the clues you gathered during the night.'
